{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28383","headline":"寄李起居四韵 · 杜牧","name":"寄李起居四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚女梅簪白雪姿，前溪碧水冻醪时。\n云罍心凸知难捧，凤管簧寒不受吹。\n南国劒眸能盼眄，侍臣香袖爱僛垂。\n自怜穷律穷途客，正怯孤灯一局碁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28383.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28383","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}